%% C4-style System Context — Hebrides Cyber
%% Canonical source. Regenerate exports with: npm run docs:diagrams
%% Reality note: boxes marked (opt) initialise to a no-op until their env/API key is set.
flowchart TB
    classDef person fill:#08427b,stroke:#052e56,color:#fff
    classDef system fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0b4884,color:#fff
    classDef ext fill:#999,stroke:#6b6b6b,color:#fff
    classDef feed fill:#2d6a4f,stroke:#1b4332,color:#fff

    subgraph Users
        U1([SMB / site owner]):::person
        U2([Developer / CI]):::person
        U3([Agency / consultant]):::person
        U4([Operator / admin]):::person
    end

    HC[["Hebrides Cyber<br/>Automated web-security scanning SaaS<br/>(single Next.js surface)"]]:::system

    U1 & U2 & U3 & U4 --> HC

    subgraph Platform_services[Platform services]
        SB[(Supabase<br/>Postgres + Auth + Storage, RLS)]:::ext
        AZ[Azure Static Web Apps<br/>+ Blob Storage]:::ext
        GH[GitHub Actions runners<br/>+ GitHub App/PAT]:::ext
        ST[Stripe<br/>billing - NOT configured in prod]:::ext
    end

    subgraph Delivery[Notifications & workflow - opt]
        NO[Slack / Teams / Jira / Linear<br/>ServiceNow / GitHub Issues<br/>PagerDuty / Opsgenie / SIEM / Resend]:::ext
        AI[Azure OpenAI<br/>AI remediation - opt]:::ext
        OB[Sentry - opt / Upstash Redis - opt]:::ext
    end

    subgraph Intel[Threat-intel & scan feeds - free/keyless]
        F1[OSV.dev]:::feed
        F2[NVD / CISA KEV / FIRST EPSS]:::feed
        F3[crt.sh CT logs]:::feed
        F4[Shodan InternetDB / Cloudflare DoH]:::feed
        F5[endoflife.date / Wayback CDX]:::feed
        F6[Google Safe Browsing - opt / HIBP - opt / WPScan - opt]:::feed
    end

    HC --> SB
    HC --> AZ
    HC --> GH
    HC --> ST
    HC --> NO
    HC --> AI
    HC --> OB
    GH -->|executeScan runs scans here| F1 & F2 & F3 & F4 & F5 & F6
